      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Failure to carry out a comprehensive assessment of a patient with leg ulcers will often delay healing owing to non-concordance with treatment. This article uses a case study to encourage health professionals to improve care by focusing on each individual patient's perspective of pain and involving patients in planning a care regimen."},
